# only. LunarG publishes the digest; bump_versions.py refreshes it with VULKAN_VERSION:
#   curl -fsSL https://sdk.lunarg.com/sdk/sha/${VULKAN_VERSION}/windows/VulkanRT-X64-${VULKAN_VERSION}-Components.zip.txt
# 18,134,567 B for 1.4.357.0 (self-measured sha256sum equal, 2026-09-23).
